{% comment %}
  Week Agenda - TRMNL private plugin (full view).
  A companion to full.liquid for the same playlist: the current week
  (Sunday to Saturday, or from the configured first day) as an easy-to-read
  list in a 4 x 2 grid: three days and today's weather on the top row, four
  days on the bottom row, with each event's time beside its title. The
  today marker moves through the week; earlier days are grayed out. It reads the same three polling URLs as full.liquid:
    IDX_0 = ?src=cal, IDX_1 = ?src=weather, IDX_2 = ?src=aqi (unused here).
  Design size is 800 x 480; fitToScreen() scales it to the device.
{% endcomment %}

<style>
