  /* Past days: near-black #333 text and a #DDD header. The TRMNL X draws 16 native
     grays, so these two shades do not dither there; #AAA and #555 text read too faint
     on e-ink. A 2-bit TRMNL OG dithers them (see ADR 0004). */
